{"obsah":"<p>We opened the Prague mini bike park in Jahodnice, where the local kiosk was also opening. The exhibition by Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček, Lukáš Valný and the little ones from the club attracted lots of spectators, who also came to ride the pump track, skills centre and jumps. After the show we joined in and tested how demanding the local jumps are – not exactly small for full-suspension bikes. Our sound system was used at the event and we signed a few autographs for local riders. Thanks for the invitation<br><br></p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F05%2F2504-0561-20.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F05%2F2504-0561-20.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250582\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F05%2F2504-0529-20.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F05%2F2504-0529-20.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250580\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F05%2F2504-0543-20.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F05%2F2504-0543-20.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250581\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads